{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_title", "source_sha256": "dd2e6053943946e40fda4f25cba813bcc7aa1ef47ecc1986218d9ad1fc20bfa6", "ja": "七つの海へ！", "zh": "前往七大洋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_synopsis", "source_sha256": "74cd2f1cf960db5b7cb3e052d1c08d6cffd44c2aaa3818fc79467f5b18913e21", "ja": "劇場の記念イベントとして、アイドル達は\n世界各地を巡ることに！　最後には集大成と\nして、大きなイベントステージで公演を行う\nという。可愛い子には旅をさせろ……という\nことで、一大イベントがスタート！", "zh": "作为剧场的纪念活动，偶像们将\n巡游世界各地！据说最后还会在大型活动舞台上\n演出，作为集大成。这正是所谓的\n“疼爱孩子就让她去旅行”……于是，一大活动正式开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "449a1ac8e8c4fd82b79aea7131c827d4c0092985b680052dea7bbb2bdee9affd", "ja": "ええと、アレはああで、コレはこうで……\nあ、{$P$}さん！　お疲れ様です。", "zh": "那个是这样，这个是那样……\n啊，{$P$}先生！辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "28ee00e573c6c0ad66538fea324473d53cedc33605933e00d9b55dddd6961378", "ja": "青羽さん。お疲れ様です。\n何か手伝いましょうか？", "zh": "青羽小姐，辛苦了。\n有什么需要我帮忙的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "9095a9d5e09ef076c1346bd7a3298fbb9b866501204f821215b81c87a715ceae", "ja": "いえ、私は大丈夫です！　それより、社長さんが\nお呼びでしたよ。ええと、アレがあっちで……", "zh": "不用，我没问题的！比起这个，社长\n好像在找你呢。呃，那个在……那边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "32bb0a69a0c3eb17e2292c8f525ed0a1f25ab9b515b7987e9035cd5423a73a2c", "ja": "お、そうでしたか！　じゃあ行かなきゃ。\nでも、本当に大丈夫ですか？　忙しそうですけど。", "zh": "哦，是这样啊！那我得过去了。\n不过，你真的没事吗？看起来很忙的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "a5b0ce27fb6326d9ecda7750d19f4202550cecc666dd7ecb14ee4d8a59903212", "ja": "大丈夫です！　忙しいけど、ワクワクしてるので！\nだって、もうすぐ劇場の記念日ですから。", "zh": "没事的！虽然忙碌，但心里也是兴奋又期待呢！\n毕竟剧场的纪念日就快要到了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "642a9f0cad956e724a7a71397b8f595ed10f53c7c6a4d0727cb73446b0e96cb7", "ja": "ああ、そういえばそうでしたね。感慨深いなぁ……\nおっといけない。行ってきます！", "zh": "啊，对了，确实是这样呢。真是感慨万千……\n哎呀，不好。那我先走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "f5e066267ceea71f4698a86a761feaf843188107a421eeb1ae5d40ecaf4ba247", "ja": "はい、行ってらっしゃーい！", "zh": "好的，路上小心——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1007_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "88d38726060acbab6f585165f5df325f178561171f210a142ce34ab7df702ff3", "ja": "お疲れ様です、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6ded8b7d47555da1b52e0e80eef806922a875569958cc9ffc16d7f3892175d1c", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れ様です。今日の話って、\nもしかして……。", "zh": "社长，音无女士，辛苦了。今天找我来，难道是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "73719e46de5752470f03c2fa0254916b0e1a903b38b0345080d2aea32dbbc897", "ja": "ふふ、相変わらず察しがいいね！\n今日君を呼んだのは他でもない。そう！", "zh": "呵呵，你还是一如既往地敏锐呢！\n今天叫你来不是为了别的。没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "5084561f8b9b1b05d4edf503dd01b777ca81d8c96d68c219e1144cf07a12c1f1", "ja": "劇場におめでとう！　記念公演！\n……の話、ですよね♪", "zh": "恭喜剧场！纪念公演！\n……是要说这个吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "07e2e46d38e83d6363cdbd76e7ebe1b32cdcea5cf49c395ea09cc7ce12bd9d28", "ja": "おお！　胸が高鳴ります。\nそれで、どんな公演にしましょうか？", "zh": "哦哦！真是令人心潮澎湃。\n那么，要举办一场什么样的公演呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1013_president", "source_sha256": "b40bda6f1c41a82f5578115a323d32e66c5af384c5304d2b98b5afa01986963f", "ja": "ふふふ、今回はね、冒険、世界、ディスカバリー\nアース……そういった、壮大なテーマで行きたい。", "zh": "呵呵，这次呢，我想围绕冒险、世界、探索地球……这样宏大的主题来做。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c4186f35f69e3f7673720477e9fe4d7c68a1a2957b6b454179a66459191df09e", "ja": "……と、いいますと？", "zh": "……您的意思是？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "49019dd0e7cd9dfe8d18799a24b41f0637a0c96ac26b641849130ebb161c3067", "ja": "アイドル諸君には、7つの海を渡って、\n世界各地へと渡ってもらいたい！", "zh": "希望各位偶像渡过7片海洋，前往世界各地！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5730568031652780d2ecdd1be09f0cd74cd1732be8db773ff4ab74c7453fbc74", "ja": "えっ、世界各地に！？", "zh": "欸，要去世界各地！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "a5ff73d8324dc678fe3e5195430bcc4209216a6979e815caae2fba5f7ed3d289", "ja": "うむ！　世界中でイベントやミニライブ、\n配信などを行うのだ。そして……。", "zh": "嗯！要在全世界举办活动、迷你演出，\n以及进行直播等。然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "a75eece97753a805c8781c263e01225d24768963d63937b88eab583c3869405a", "ja": "大団円となる記念公演は、それらの集大成に相応しい、\n特別なステージで行う！　どうかね？", "zh": "作为圆满结局的纪念演出，要在足以作为集大成的、\n特别的舞台上举行！你觉得如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "c2a0aa6fb09dfabebde87dae63d44e80b924f8affb88acf97ab9fb108055a87e", "ja": "す、すごい……！　なんてスケールの大きい話なんだ！\nさすがです、社長！", "zh": "好、好厉害……！这真是规模宏大的计划啊！\n不愧是社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "e741628f0e1f3e73e6c47929fb38b4b1e84980ad80d05d115a9fbc4bb417afa4", "ja": "ファンからすると、全部の現地リアタイは大変そう\nですけど……今は配信も充実してるからいいですよね。", "zh": "对粉丝来说，要全部到现场实时观看，感觉会很辛苦，\n不过……现在直播也很方便，这样就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "42213b5480d338c64621790d9f08ab79a43c592fbbcbff5696d07e52a425613c", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんが\n一人でプロデュースするの、大変なような……？", "zh": "不过，让{$P$}先生一个人负责制作，好像也挺辛苦的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "e58a9f18b643a276cf83564acd662cee260395211ffc1b171e8d6560858a26ac", "ja": "そこは、スタッフやアイドル諸君の力も借りることに\nなるだろうね。かわいい子には旅をさせろ、だよ。", "zh": "到时候也得借助工作人员和各位偶像的力量了。所谓“疼爱孩子，就该让他出去闯荡”嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "2cd9f8747f759a7699e68463a9b623312b09533687ad5b371852e3442718e5b1", "ja": "うぅ、ちょっと心配ですけど……。\nみんななら、大丈夫ですよね、きっと。", "zh": "唔，虽然有点担心……\n但如果是大家的话，一定没问题的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "e7e5401cb7551d620a84e6edec218c6eee40155bdeb489e43d445b5bf0b55369", "ja": "わかりました！　アイドルのみんなと協力して、\nこの大プロジェクトを成功させてみせます！", "zh": "明白了！我会和偶像们齐心协力，\n一定要让这个大项目成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0339_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0339_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b842b1da822fc2cc1843b2df1338bbdced2328b5d3fa3fa3d8937ab090b80e74", "ja": "（世界を股に掛けるアイドル達、そして、\n特別なステージ……素晴らしいものになりそうだ！）", "zh": "（活跃于世界各地的偶像们，还有特别的舞台……一定会变成一场精彩的演出！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
